      "name": "Technical assessment",
      "description": "The team of each requested quantum system assesses whether the proposal can run there: accepted, conditionally accepted or rejected. Conditionally accepted forwards the proposal to a quantum emulator first; the condition says what the benchmark must show. A rejected system rejects the proposal.",
